597 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186265096 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265597 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c7c3c66d-9b18-5c7a-bf81-ae419bdf2386" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186263020 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264156 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264479 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186264946 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186265097 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186264479 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265651 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "e5a9a315-8af0-5512-bbf8-ebf3e0bd6e5b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186265651 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1069 "q-129268" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)+⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,6,\\,0⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "620fd628-6fe2-5040-9cd0-aaf37f31206b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265705 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-3,\\,6,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)+⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{0}⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩+⟨3t,\\,t,\\,-2t⟩{|}_{4}^{0} \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩+⟨-12,\\,-4,\\,8⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-9,\\,-10,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186265597 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1069 "q-129295" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1071 "Find ${\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$ \ngiven that \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=i+j-3\\,k$ \nand \n$c=i-j+2\\,k.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "553c9eff-921e-5636-9757-6a75aa064098" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186265710 #edb/ref 1074 "The cross-product rule states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the cross-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}c\\times f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\times {\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(i-j+2\\,k)\\times (i+j-3\\,k) \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3-2)i-(-3-2)j+(1+1)k \\\\  & =i+5\\,j+2\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358358 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨10,\\,6,\\,1⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358358 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358358 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "46bf7675-80a2-559b-8162-709a1a0d7f2f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358461 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨7,\\,2,\\,11⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358461 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186358461 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "52b55dd5-256e-5209-86de-a9c9700d2990" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186359017 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨-10,\\,9,\\,-11⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186359017 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186359017 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "90b044f6-737d-5f41-adc8-0bdca392f181" #edb/ref 175