61994 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186361236 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186361994 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186361341 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186361994 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186361994 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186361994 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186361177 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186361994 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0f30ce34-a100-52c6-8920-e8e760ecaf3f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186360844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186360945 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186361060 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186361228 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186361517 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186360844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362082 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7a64d838-42a9-50de-a90f-4fbf80d5585a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186362082 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1069 "q-98189" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "920d3899-d202-5cde-aad8-d129368027e5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362275 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨2,\\,-4,\\,6⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)-⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨3,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ⟨-2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩-{⟨3t,\\,-t,\\,-2t⟩|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,-3⟩-⟨6,\\,-2,\\,-4⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-7,\\,4,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186361994 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1069 "q-98216" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{3}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨8,\\,-6,\\,15⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{4}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "18499165-c282-509c-946c-50bba51e2c16" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186362277 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{3}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{3}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{3}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{4}^{6}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨8,\\,-6,\\,15⟩-⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨10,\\,-9,\\,11⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186388000 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1069 "q-129149" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "57f0244e-104a-5517-a9c5-a53620a2a15d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387999 #edb/ref 1074 "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩+4⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6,\\,2\\sqrt{2},\\,4⟩+⟨-6,\\,-1,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-12,\\,2\\sqrt{2}-1,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388001 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388002 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388003 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388004 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388005 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186388005 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388000 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "08002127-d475-5849-b316-13394942fb74" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388001 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨-12,\\,2\\sqrt{2}+1,\\,0⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388001 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388001 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "afc8add8-a972-543e-ba5d-502649377eed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388002 #edb/ref 1080 "⟨-5,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2,\\,4⟩" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388002 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186388002 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "88d76c60-f635-5b53-b9a2-21eb7b22c38d" #edb/ref 175921